'''にゃんこ大戦争大図鑑''' (''Nyanko Daisensō Dai Zukan'', '''Nyanko Great War Encyclopedia''') is a Japanese manga that was published on August 1st, 2013 by [[wikipedia:Shufu-to-Seikatsu Sha|Shufu-to-Seikatsu Sha]].

