==Contents==
We've all been waiting! You've been waiting for this!<br>
The first official illustrated book of the kimo-kawaii cats from the popular game app "[[Nyanko Daisensou|The Great Cat War]]", which has been downloaded 6 million times, is finally here!

≪What's in this book≫<br>
*This book contains all 58 [[Cat Units|cat characters]] and 23 [[Enemy Units|enemy characters]]! You will be able to understand the specs of each character in the game.<br>
*This book contains many special contents that can only be seen in this book. There are many special contents that you can only see in this book, such as "newly drawn illustrations", "128-frame full movie parapara manga", "picture letter kit", "Iroha karuta set", "super elaborate 3D paper craft kit", "[[Cat God|God]] mask kit", ...... and many more, & also a lot of column pages.
*Contains everything from basic strategies for beginners to hints for difficult stages. It includes everything from the basics to hints and tips.

